f a system error, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. Retrying the same rollback finished it in all three regions.\n2. **Check:** checkout-api now shows as healthy on v2.3.0 everywhere, and its error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to open the SEV2 incident timed out, but the incident list showed it had been created, so I didn't send it again and only one person was paged. The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state.\n\nThe incident also lists two follow-ups:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed. Its release candidate was already failing health checks in staging before it went to production.\n- Find out what caused the error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}